Khal Drogo — his remaining khalasar eddies and sluices away after his fall;  
Khal Pono — rides with a host that streams across the grass sea;  
Khal Jhaqo — his riders trickle and surge in raiding currents;  
Khal Mengo — his strength has run out, his wake gone still;  
Khal Ogo — his name lingers like a slow seep through the Dothraki Sea;  
Khal Moro — the khalasar that takes Daenerys swells and pours onward under his lead.
